# Biosynthic Burst, {1}{G}: "Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control. It gains reach, trample, and indestructible until
# end of turn. Untap it." Llanowar Elves, tapped for the {G} that pays for it, becomes an untapped 2/2 with the three keywords, which
# wear off at the end of the turn (the counter stays). Bot2's Ornithopter is not a creature Bot1 controls, so it is no target.

